        <h3>Tallulah Gorge</h3>
        <p>Tallulah Falls, GA — a thousand-foot canyon, three waterfalls, and a suspension bridge with a view.</p>
        <a href="/sami/tallulah-gorge/" class="recipe-link">Read the adventure &rarr;</a>
      </div>
      <div class="stop-card">
        <div class="pin">🐐</div>
        <h3>Saturday Farmers Market</h3>
        <p>North Georgia — a fiddle player, a tote-bag tumble, and one very opinionated goat.</p>
        <a href="/sami/saturday-farmers-market/" class="recipe-link">Read the adventure &rarr;</a>
      </div>
      <div class="stop-card">
        <div class="pin">🦇</div>
        <h3>Mammoth Cave</h3>
        <p>Mammoth Cave NP, KY — 426 miles of cave, thirteen kinds of bats, and not one of them available for the Giants.</p>
        <a href="/sami/mammoth-cave/" class="recipe-link">Read the adventure &rarr;</a>
      </div>
      <div class="stop-card">
        <div class="pin">🌽</div>
        <h3>Ocmulgee Mounds</h3>
        <p>Macon, GA — one very determined squirrel and a thousand years of proof he didn't see coming.</p>
        <a href="/sami/ocmulgee-mounds/" class="recipe-link">Read the adventure &rarr;</a>
      </div>
      <div class="stop-card">
        <div class="pin">🌾</div>
        <h3>Milledgeville</h3>
        <p>Milledgeville, GA — a bacon riot, a flour riot, a few ghosts, and a nervous sandwich who really did stay away from Central State.</p>
        <a href="/sami/milledgeville-flour-riots/" class="recipe-link">Read the adventure &rarr;</a>
      </div>
      <div class="stop-card">
        <div class="pin">🌷</div>
